/Title (SHR-HLVDIR50RF HD Dual Sensor Forest Fire Prevention System integrates thermal imaging camera with temperature alarm function, visible camera, pantilt, etc. The system can achieve unattended work uninterrupted. It can analysis the video info and make the judgement automatically, timely detection the signs of fire in the surveillance area, in the fastest and best way to send the alarm, and minimize false positives; at the same time, you can check the real-time videos of the scene and directly dispatch the fire control according to the visual images, effectively assist the firefighters to deal with fire crisis.)
